sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant API as Auth API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  C->>API: Login
  API->>DB: Create session + refresh-token hash
  API-->>C: Access + refresh token
  C->>API: Refresh
  API->>DB: Atomically consume old token
  API->>DB: Create replacement token
  API-->>C: New token pair
